/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/006.md:9:> - **空间关系类**：边缘对齐控制点/edges_align_control, 阵列排布/array_layout, 颜色对应形状/color_to_shape, 端点朝向/endpoint_facing, 行列对应/row_column_mapping, 尺寸比编码缩放/size_ratio_encodes_scale, 对角互补/diagonal_complement, 对角放射/diagonal_radiation, 路径连接/path_connected, 颜色循环/color_cycle, 旋转对称/rotational_symmetry, 模板与副本匹配/template_copy_match, 列归属/column_membership, 按类型分列/type_determines_column, 标记在分量内/marker_inside_component, 弯折数分类/bend_count_class, 平行配对/parallel_pairing, 边框色映射填充色/border_to_fill_mapping, 碰撞反弹/collision_bounce, 标记计数驱动重复/marker_count_drives_repetition, 标记归属最近线/marker_assigned_to_nearest_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/006.md:10:> - **条件/判断类**：控制点定拉伸界/control_stretch_bound, 含标记涂标记色/marker_presence_color, 锚点定位/anchor_position, 色板决定填色/swatch_determines_fill, 象限决定反射轴/quadrant_determines_reflection, 对角空位补块/complement_at_diagonal_vacancies, 延伸至边界/extend_to_edge, 终点相邻/endpoint_adjacent, 条纹范围差异/stripe_scope_difference, 提取原始瓦片/extract_source_tile, 非标记精确匹配/non_marker_match, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 列序映射颜色/column_rank_to_color, 内部判定类型/interior_determines_type, 邻域全包含/full_neighborhood_inside_component, 弯折数决定颜色/bend_count_color, 段间区域填充/fill_between_segments, 编码映射/encoding_map, 射线遇障碍翻转/ray_flips_on_obstacle, 标记数等于副本数/marker_count_equals_copy_count
