/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:5:> 提取的原语：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:6:> - 操作类：滑动(sliding), 填充(fill), 补全(completion), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 延伸(extend), 平铺(tile), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 射线延伸(ray_extend), 搜索(search), 裁剪(crop), 连线(path_painting), 贪心遍历(greedy_traversal), 重涂色(recolor), 循环轮换(cyclic_shift), 镜像(mirror), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 拉伸(stretch), 擦除(erase), 延伸填充(extension_fill), 周期填充(periodic_fill), 射线投射(ray_cast)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:7:> - 对象类：前景对象(foreground_object), 最大实心矩形(largest_solid_rect), 边框(border), 遮挡像素(occluding_pixel), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 封闭行段(closed_row_segment), 周期图案(periodic_pattern), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 整幅画布(full_grid), 空心矩形(rectangular_frame), 边框缺口(border_gap), 空心矩形区域(empty_rect_region), 背景空间(background_space), 纵条(vertical_bar), 起始块(start_block), 目标块(target_block), 走廊路径(corridor_path), 分隔结构(divider_structure), 分离区域(separated_region), 色条(color_bar), 侧翼列(flanking_column), 网格线(grid_line), 缺口(gap), 边界点(boundary_dot), 伴随点(companion_dot), 边缘矩形(edge_rectangle), 轨迹条纹(trail_stripe), 主色前景对象(dominant_fg_object), 中轴线(center_axis), 紧凑原型(compact_prototype), 稀疏骨架锚点(sparse_anchor), 线段(line_segment), 精灵体(sprite), 反射轴标记(reflection_axis_marker), 连通分量(connected_component), 引导像素(guide_pixel)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:8:> - 空间关系类：方向(direction), 内部区域(interior_region), 对称轨道(symmetry_orbit), 边界包围内部(boundary_encloses_interior), 周期(period), 重复(repetition), 距离控制高度(distance_controls_height), 同行同列对齐(row_or_column_aligned), 视线可见(line_of_sight_visible), 环绕角度排序(angular_order_around_center), 距离(distance), 行列对齐(row_col_align), 周期步长(periodic_step), 接触边缘(touching_edge), 对称(symmetry), 顶点坐标映射(vertex_coord_mapping), 标记几何定类型(marker_geometry_determines_type), 面积比较(area_comparison), 角落定位(corner_positioning)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:9:> - 条件类：固定步长平移(fixed_step_translate), 保留边框填内部(keep_border_fill_in), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 反射旋转定颜色(reflect_rotate_color), 前缀图案闭合延展(prefix_pattern_closure_extension), 宽度加倍延续周期(double_width_continuing_period), 缺口方向决定射线(gap_direction_determines_ray), 最大矩形填充(largest_rect_filled), 最小边长约束(min_side_constraint), 宽度加倍拼接(width_doubling_concatenation), 不对称递变(asymmetric_gradient), 视线遮挡判断(line_of_sight_blocked), 最近未访问优先(nearest_unvisited_first), 距离决定阶梯高度(distance_determines_step_height), 同余对齐(modular_alignment), 相邻像素标有效线(adjacent_marks_line), 缺口补另色(gaps_filled_other_color), 滑至对侧边缘(slide_to_opposite), 最高频色为目标(most_frequent_target), 编码映射(encoding_map), 选取最大面积对象(largest_area_selected), 角落色转移后消(corner_color_transfer_vanish), 行列独立拉伸(independent_stretch)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:10:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:11:> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/029.md:12:
