/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/024.md:6:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/024.md:7:> - 操作类：连线(connect), 平移(translate), 射线延伸(ray_extend/ray_cast), 重涂色(recolor), 排序(sorting), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 裁剪(crop), 序列外推(sequence_extrapolation), 投票恢复(majority_vote_recovery), 擦除(erase), 填充(fill), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 拼接(stitch), 连通分量检测(connected_component_detection), 计数(counting), 坐标压缩(coordinate_compression), 平移对齐(translate_align), 分叉(branching)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/024.md:8:> - 对象类：同色矩形对(same_color_rect_pair), 对角线段(diagonal_segment), 空心框(hollow_frame), 路径端点(path_endpoint), 细条(thin_bar), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 空心矩形(hollow_rectangle), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 遮挡矩形(occluding_rect), 种子像素(seed_pixel), 障碍像素(obstacle_pixel), 条纹(stripe), 面板帧(panel_frame), 分隔行(separator_row), 前景精灵(foreground_sprite), 精灵体/精灵图(sprite), 插槽阵列(slot_array), 分隔线(divider_line), 实心正方形(solid_square), 对角标记(diag_marker), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 实心方块(solid_block), 十字图案(cross_pattern), 标记点阵(marker_lattice), 格元(lattice_cell), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 面板(panel), 分隔列(separator_column), 连接标记(connector_marker), 前景物体(foreground_object), 单色连通体(monochrome_connected_object), 控制像素(control_pixel), 单色矩形(monochrome_rect), 定位标记(anchor_marker)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/024.md:9:> - 空间关系类：对角偏移(diagonal_offset), 对角射线(diagonal_ray), 长度排名(length_ranking), 包围(enclosure), 二面体对称(dihedral_symmetry), 行传播(row_propagation), 等距堆叠(equally_spaced_stacking), 行列带对齐(row_column_band_alignment), 面积比较(area_comparison), 对角邻接(diag_adjacency), 行列对齐(row_col_align), 格元内居中(centered_within_cell), 同色配对(same_color_pairing), 图层优先级(layer_priority), 同色标记对齐对接(same_color_dock), 列范围包含(column_span_contains), 块距离(block_distance)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/024.md:10:> - 条件类：对角补全连接(diagonal_fill), 端点编码位移(endpoints_encode_disp), 排名决定颜色(rank_determines_color), 面积决定填充色(area_determines_fill_color), 可见副本恢复遮挡(visible_recover_occluded), 碰撞产生侧翼(collision_generates_side_wakes), 种子色决定延伸(seed_color_determines_extend), 恒定偏移平移(constant_offset_translation), 密集带检测(dense_band_detection), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 极值区域分别涂色(extreme_regions_recolor), 锚角对角射线至边(anchor_diag_to_edge), 交叉点重置背景(intersect_reset_bg), 两端同色整行填充(full_row_fill_endpoints_match), 循环序决定优先级(cyclic_order_determines_priority), 标记侧面决定方向(marker_side_dir), 面积阈值筛选(area_threshold_filter), 控制色决定填色(control_fill_color), 沙漏距离谓词(hourglass_distance_predicate), 象限位决定层序(quadrant_layer_order)
