/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:5:> 提取的原语：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:6:> - 操作类：反转填充/occupancy_inversion, 重涂色/recolor, 计数/counting, 压缩/compress, 对齐/align, 填充/fill, 平移/translate, 分裂/split, 射线延伸/ray_extension, 外推/extrapolate, 补全/completion, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 旋转/rotate, 镜像/mirror, 印章渲染/stamp_rendering, 解码/decoding, 堆叠/stack, 裁剪/crop, 重力下落/gravity_drop, 擦除/erase, 聚集/gather, 翻转/flip, 生成网格/generate_grid, 拼接/assemble
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:7:> - 对象类：瓷砖·瓦片/tile, 分隔行列/separator_rows_and_columns, 前景对象/foreground_object, 封闭背景区域/enclosed_bg_region, 标记行/marker_row, 双色竖条/two_color_bar, 实心矩形/solid_rectangle, 网格边缘/grid_edge, 等距标记点/equally_spaced_markers, 算术线/arithmetic_line, 同形精灵体/identical_sprite, 行列格点/row_column_lattice, 前景矩形/foreground_rect, 矩形内部/rect_interior, 顶行色带/top_row_band, 收缩楔形/shrinking_wedge, 精灵体/sprite, 锚点像素/anchor_pixel, 模板掩码/template_mask, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 调色板/palette_swatch, 对角色带/diag_color_band, 象限/quadrant, 色段/color_run, 水像素/water_pixel, 盆地/basin, 障碍物/obstacle, 角括号/corner_bracket, 墙壁障碍/wall_barrier, 目标块/destination_block, 分区条纹/partition_stripe, 网格线/grid_line, 实心方块/solid_square, 矩形精灵体/rectangular_sprite
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:8:> - 空间关系类：瓷砖网格排列/tile_grid_layout, 顺序排列/ordered_arrangement, 基线对齐/baseline_aligned, 轴线排列/axis_arrangement, 等距共线/equally_spaced_collinear, 格点对齐/lattice_alignment, 内外分离/interior_exterior_sep, 沿对角线传播/diagonal_propagate, 颜色一致对齐/color_consistent_align, 颜色索引模板/color_indexes_template, 周期重复/periodic_repeat, 逐行递增/row_by_row_increment, 包含/containment, 沿路径滑动/slide_along_path, 周期/period, 标记在括号内部/marker_inside_bracket, 可达性/reachability, 计数匹配/count_matching, 边长决定间距/side_length_determines_spacing, 锚定定位/anchor_positioning
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：孔洞面积决定输出/enclosed_area_output, 最大高度归一化/max_height_normalize, 穿越并分开/pass_through_split, 边界内延续/continue_within_bounds, 笛卡尔积缺位填充/cartesian_product_gap_fill, 保留边框涂内部/keep_border_fill_inside, 逐行交换双色/row_swap_bicolor, 稀疏像素引导放置/sparse_pixels_guide_placement, 编码映射/encoding_map, 画布倍增/canvas_doubled, 每行递增扩展/row_incremental_expand, 标记最多者选取/rectangle_with_most_markers_selected, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 最小周期含翻转/smallest_period_flipped, 按标记色选择同色/select_same_color_by_marker, 保留标记本身/preserve_marker_itself, 距离排序填充/distance_ranked_fill, 标记色定朝向/marker_color_sets_orientation, 等距参数化/uniform_parameterized_spacing, 标记定输出朝向/marker_fixes_orientation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/038.md:10:>
