/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/027.md:6:> - 操作类：重涂色/recolor, 裁剪/crop, 筛选/filter, 计数/counting, 压缩/compress, 外推/extrapolate, 平移/translate, 生长/grow, 印章覆盖/stamp, 擦除/erase, 轮廓描边/outline_trace, 洪泛填充/flood_fill, 排序/sort, 滑动/slide, 镜像/mirror, 连线/line_drawing, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 嵌入对齐/insert_and_align, 堆叠/stacking, 绘点/draw_dots, 模板匹配/template_matching, 对称补全/symmetry_completion, 旋转/rotate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/027.md:7:> - 对象类：双列图例/two_col_legend, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 精灵体/sprite, 干扰体/distractor, 连通分量/connected_component, 堆叠掩码/stacked_mask, 背景交集/bg_intersection, 帧序列/frame_sequence, 内部精灵/inner_sprite, 种子行/seed_row, 色条图例/color_bar_legend, 插槽/slot, 轮廓线/outline, 标记色/marker_color, 分隔线/divider_line, 封闭区域/bounded_region, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 障碍轮廓/obstacle_contour, 包围框/bounding_box, 标记条/marker_bar, 控制像素/control_pixel, 目标对象/target_object, 面板/panel, 分隔列/separator_col, 前景掩码/fg_mask, 框架槽/frame_slot, 凸起条/bar_with_projections, 空心框架/hollow_frame, 图案精灵体/pattern_sprite, 模板图案/template_motif, 前景对象/foreground_object, 轴对齐线段/axis_aligned_segment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/027.md:8:> - 空间关系类：图例行序决定替换/legend_row_order, 面积分级/area_ranking, 逐格比较/cell_comparison, 等间距排列/equal_spacing, 相邻间隔/adjacent_gap, 图例顺序对应插槽/legend_order_to_slot, 外侧相邻/outer_adjacent, 位置排序/positional_ordering, 轮廓邻接/contour_adjacency, 包围框包含/bbox_containment, 颜色配对/color_pairing, 同色配对/same_color_pairing, 共行或共列/shared_row_or_column, 射线命中/ray_intersection, 对齐/alignment, 列对齐/column_alignment, 同色匹配/same_color_matching, 形状匹配/shape_matching, 旋转对称/rotational_symmetry
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/027.md:9:> - 条件类：逐行顺序链式替换/chain_replace, 对称性筛选目标/symmetry_filter, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 面积决定颜色/area_determines_color, 双背景标记输出/both_bg_marks, 匀速运动延续/constant_motion, 交替变色/alternating_color, 间隔行生成/gap_row_generate, 缺失色补入对应位/missing_color_fill_slot, 最小色为画笔/smallest_as_paint, 位置决定填充色/position_determines_fill_color, 最长贴边路径/longest_adjacent_path, 异色包含则删/delete_if_contained_by_other_color, 标记色匹配目标位/marker_color_matches_dest, 特定标记触发镜像/marker_triggers_mirror, 纵线覆盖横线/vertical_over_horizontal_priority, 命中即整体擦除/hit_erases_whole, 双面背景交集标记/both_bg_intersect_mark, 凸起匹配标记列/projections_match_columns, 计数映射点数/count_maps_to_dots, 含旋转反射变换/includes_rotation_reflection, 非重叠放置/non_overlapping_placement, 面积超阈值则变色/recolor_above_threshold, 旋转恢复缺失像素/rotation_restores_missing
