/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/041.md:6:> - 操作类：描边/outline, 洪泛填充/flood_fill, 连线/connect, 填充/fill, 拼接/stitch, 偏移放置/offset_placement, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 逻辑或合并/logical_or_merge, 重涂色/recolor, 镜像/mirror, 平铺/tiling, 裁剪/crop, 拼接/concatenate, 印章覆盖/stamp_repeat, 滑动/translate, 计数/counting, 擦除/erase, 滑动/slide, 对称补全/symmetric_complete, 像素放大/pixel_scaling, 周期扩展/periodic_expand, 中心重建/center_reconstruct, 射线延伸/ray_cast, 连线/draw_path, 避障/obstacle_avoidance, 图案印章/stamp_glyph, 裁剪/clip, 包络生成/envelope_generation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/041.md:7:> - 对象类：前景形状/foreground_shape, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 外部邻接区域/exterior_adj_region, 对称标记对/mirrored_marker_pair, 间隔段/gap_segment, 半区域/half_region, 分隔填充/separator_fill, 开顶矩形框/open_top_rect_frame, 方向帽/direction_cap, 掩码/mask, 分隔列/separator_column, 瓦片/tile, 精灵体/sprite, 实心矩形/solid_rectangle, 中心像素/center_pixel, 前景对象/foreground_object, 封闭背景区域/enclosed_background_region, 双色多米诺/bicolor_domino, 配对像素/paired_pixel, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 目标像素/target_pixel, 凸起/tab, 缺口/notch, 边界/boundary, 填充色块/fill_block, 块阵列/block_array, 空心中心/hollow_center, 对角线段/diagonal_segment, 引导体/guide_object, 路径起点/path_start, 障碍条/obstacle_bar, 禁区/exclusion_zone, 控制像素/control_pixel, 字形字典/glyph_dictionary, 示例图例/sample_legend, 矩形框/rect_frame, 图案块/motif, 实心条/solid_bar, 菱形轮廓/diamond_outline
