/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/041.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：孔洞填色轮廓描色/holes_fill_outline, 最小间距对触发/min_gap_triggered, 缺口不对称/gap_asymmetry, 双轴反射四象限/both_axes_four_quadrants, 复制拼接为两份/duplicate_side_by_side, 重叠停止/overlap_stop, 孔洞数映射颜色/hole_count_to_color_mapping, 配对则变色擦除/pair_recolor_erase, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 趋近目标/approach_target, 跨行列投射/cross_span_projection, 标记位决定展开/marker_pos_sets_expansion, 边界像素编码/border_pixel_encoding, 引导体定新对角线/guide_tip_seeds_parallel_diagonal, 编码映射/encoding_map, 边色不符则翻转/mismatch_flip, 逐步收缩/stepwise_shrink, 最密堆叠最小框/densest_minimal_bbox
